{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "english", "appid": 924970, "month": "2024-08", "window": 1, "start_date": 1722470400, "end_date": 1723161599, "month_true_total": 179, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 20:52:18 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "171710375", "author": {"steamid": "76561198344819526", "personaname": "The Bloody Scarecrow", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198344819526/", "num_games_owned": 246, "num_reviews": 41, "playtime_forever": 308, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 221, "last_played": 1723167244, "avatar": "700c76ab9e0ca492a71b9128dae220b989fe0ec2"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's no Left 4 dead 3 but its pretty good in it's own right.", "timestamp_created": 1723154383, "timestamp_updated": 1723154383, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "171686260", "author": {"steamid": "76561198080349764", "personaname": "Mandoooo00", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198080349764/", "num_games_owned": 105, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 379, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 379, "last_played": 1721582247, "avatar": "9a209dadc8d32614509fe7252ffb86fb82b3d3e3"}, "language": "english", "review": "Killing zombies makes me happy", "timestamp_created": 1723128103, "timestamp_updated": 1723128103, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "171677261", "author": {"steamid": "76561198439249542", "personaname": "God", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198439249542/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 209, "playtime_forever": 15382, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 15382, "last_played": 1786274582, "avatar": "4ab3db0761bdfb0b02c32de00e0924e1270cf81a"}, "language": "english", "review": "+ Better than Left for Dead 2. Ignored this game for years because of the bad reviews but then finally got it on sale and tried it. It has greatly improved since launch.\n\n- Gameplay is amazing, it is a roguelike L4D, much more interesting than L4D2, you collect cards(perks) and can build a deck of 15 cards and make a play style. Select from many characters with different perks. When mission starts you can find random cards throughout the run and random weapons all with different quality & also can find attatchments.\n\n- So many weapons, both primary and secondary, melee weapons take up a secondary slot so you can still have a primary, you can carry 2 primaries if you take a perk. Never can go back tg L4D, it only has a handful of guns, it was good for its time.\n\n- Only downside is not many players, there is AI, but anyway if you have friends to play with this isn't a problem.", "timestamp_created": 1723117841, "timestamp_updated": 1785937058, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.481481492519378662", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "171677223", "author": {"steamid": "76561199466178037", "personaname": "darksectorindreams", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199466178037/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 3926, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3646, "last_played": 1733916263, "avatar": "f33afe346736fb3093fe4af7f0be0ba8647a352e"}, "language": "english", "review": "love this game", "timestamp_created": 1723117798, "timestamp_updated": 1723117798, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.497925341129302979", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "171671213", "author": {"steamid": "76561198141996555", "personaname": "big_Nana", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198141996555/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 15408, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 264, "playtime_at_review": 2545, "last_played": 1787504484, "avatar": "5331b97ef8ae320e6480debde6dcd49c333fe061"}, "language": "english", "review": "I've been playing left4dead ever since it came out (which is a loong time ago) and I couldn't make myself anyother game as that zombie game took a special place in my heart. But, serfing through Steam discount section I saw Back4Blood and thought 'hey, i'll give it a try, why not' and OH MY GOOOD, it's so good!! I love that each and every campain connects with the previous one, that there's always a little preview of a story what's about to happen or what happened long ago. I also love charachter and weapon modifications, as well as different perks you can attach to the charachter!", "timestamp_created": 1723109638, "timestamp_updated": 1723109638, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}]}